WEBVTT

01:36.550 --> 01:39.979
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.030 --> 01:42.050
[Episode 10]

01:52.979 --> 01:53.590
All right.

01:57.880 --> 01:59.150
Hey,

01:59.310 --> 02:01.220
you don't look bad with makeup on.

02:06.930 --> 02:08.460
Here you go, for the two of you.

02:10.139 --> 02:11.210
Let's eat something first.

02:11.240 --> 02:13.080
Then, we'll find an internet cafe

02:13.100 --> 02:13.940
and stay up until dawn.

02:14.030 --> 02:15.740
We'll take the first bus tomorrow morning

02:15.780 --> 02:16.750
to go back to Flower Street.

02:17.829 --> 02:18.340
Here.

02:21.070 --> 02:22.960
How did you know I would be in trouble?

02:25.190 --> 02:27.250
When your mom asked me to look at the contract last time,

02:27.280 --> 02:28.810
I felt a bit uneasy.

02:29.310 --> 02:30.430
So I asked Haikuo

02:30.430 --> 02:32.340
to investigate this studio.

02:32.450 --> 02:33.890
They have a website. From there,

02:33.910 --> 02:35.350
we found an email address from their contact.

02:34.550 --> 02:38.020
[System Management Log-in]

02:35.390 --> 02:36.620
With that, we found out

02:36.670 --> 02:37.310
that this email

02:37.310 --> 02:40.430
was also registered to an online photo album.

02:40.630 --> 02:42.670
Zhou Haikuo hacked into this online album.

02:42.670 --> 02:43.930
When we looked at it,

02:43.970 --> 02:45.250
we got so furious.

02:47.760 --> 02:49.290
This is definitely a gang of perverts.

02:49.320 --> 02:50.270
Let's call the police.

02:50.520 --> 02:52.180
The extent of this isn't illegal yet.

02:53.020 --> 02:54.350
Calling the police won't help.

02:54.640 --> 02:55.530
They can't file a case.

02:55.630 --> 02:56.430
If Fenghua takes these kinds of photos,

02:56.430 --> 02:57.960
the school will definitely expel her.

02:58.090 --> 02:59.710
If she doesn't take them, they'll say she breached the contract

02:59.740 --> 03:00.750
and make her pay a penalty.

03:03.310 --> 03:04.910
These bastards are really despicable.

03:05.820 --> 03:07.360
Then I rushed to your house,

03:07.780 --> 03:09.350
but your mom said you had already gone downtown.

03:09.380 --> 03:11.360
So I hurried over here in a panic.

03:12.510 --> 03:14.260
Fortunately, I arrived in time,

03:15.020 --> 03:15.860
Fenghua.

03:15.900 --> 03:18.770
Otherwise, the consequences would have been unimaginable.

03:21.510 --> 03:23.610
How did you know I was in this hotel?

03:23.710 --> 03:25.079
You even knew the room number.

03:25.680 --> 03:27.870
Haikuo and Xingchi went to the police station

03:28.050 --> 03:29.280
saying you were missing.

03:29.329 --> 03:30.540
They gave them your ID number.

03:30.579 --> 03:31.900
The police looked it up.

03:33.160 --> 03:35.079
That old police officer who arrested you last time?

03:35.110 --> 03:35.590
Yes.

03:36.050 --> 03:37.440
We're lucky to have him this time.

03:37.540 --> 03:38.750
Otherwise, you'd have been done for.

03:40.510 --> 03:41.579
Where are those two?

03:41.740 --> 03:42.680
Why didn't they come?

03:43.230 --> 03:44.490
We've already agreed.

03:44.800 --> 03:46.270
They're waiting at the police station entrance.

03:46.470 --> 03:47.630
If anything happens here,

03:47.630 --> 03:48.430
I'll call them

03:48.470 --> 03:49.350
and they'll alert the police.

03:49.370 --> 03:50.930
They'll come over with the police.

03:54.880 --> 03:55.750
Come on,

03:57.079 --> 03:58.560
let's celebrate your narrow escape.

04:09.310 --> 04:11.240
I thought my luck would finally turn around this time.

04:12.350 --> 04:13.310
Who knew...

04:13.750 --> 04:15.510
It's a blessing nothing bad happened.

04:15.530 --> 04:16.740
You should be grateful.

04:18.190 --> 04:20.459
Can you stop getting involved in these things from now on?

04:20.950 --> 04:22.630
Even if pies were falling from the sky,

04:22.730 --> 04:24.720
you wouldn't be the one to catch them.

04:30.250 --> 04:31.350
Hey, I saved you!

04:31.350 --> 04:32.710
Was that all for nothing?

04:34.760 --> 04:36.310
I didn't ask you to come save me.

04:36.590 --> 04:38.210
Who told you to meddle in my affairs?

04:39.340 --> 04:40.220
Fine.

04:40.670 --> 04:41.680
Fenghua,

04:42.080 --> 04:43.700
this is the last time I'm helping you.

04:44.040 --> 04:46.020
From now on, even if you're in deep trouble,

04:46.040 --> 04:46.790
I won't care.

04:46.790 --> 04:47.790
I'll just stand by and watch.

04:47.790 --> 04:48.700
I'll make you so angry.

04:53.430 --> 04:54.530
Make you so angry.

05:04.700 --> 05:06.160
Sir, thank you for the medicine.

05:06.390 --> 05:07.550
Come again.

05:10.070 --> 05:11.180
I'm here to rescue you.

05:11.230 --> 05:12.350
Let's forget about the cab fare.

05:12.390 --> 05:14.270
I still have to pay for the meal. Seriously?

05:15.970 --> 05:17.730
I'll pay for the internet cafe. How's that.

05:17.790 --> 05:18.680
Drinks too.

05:18.950 --> 05:19.790
I want iced tea.

05:19.790 --> 05:21.550
I'll drink until you go bankrupt today.

05:32.020 --> 05:35.790
♫What would I do without you?♫

05:35.790 --> 05:36.480
Wrong.

05:37.030 --> 05:39.920
It's "what would you do without me?"

05:40.230 --> 05:41.270
All right, stop singing.

05:41.300 --> 05:42.220
You sound terrible.

05:42.220 --> 05:46.430
♫What would you do without me?♫

05:46.750 --> 05:51.070
♫Who would wipe away your tears?♫

05:51.120 --> 05:53.470
♫Who would hold an umbrella for you?♫

05:53.470 --> 05:55.909
♫Comfort you when you're troubled♫

05:55.909 --> 06:00.590
♫On sleepless nights, you fear loneliness the most♫

06:03.070 --> 06:04.000
Sounds good.

06:04.110 --> 06:04.870
No fun. Forget it.

06:04.870 --> 06:06.310
Let me carry you on my back instead. Come on.

06:07.110 --> 06:07.550
Come on.

06:10.350 --> 06:14.030
What would you do without me?

06:14.670 --> 06:18.790
Who would wipe away your tears?

06:27.990 --> 06:29.990
Do you think I should return the money?

06:31.780 --> 06:33.020
It's best to do so.

06:33.590 --> 06:35.970
Otherwise, they might cause trouble.

06:36.350 --> 06:39.360
Why would they? After how that guy treated me...

06:39.610 --> 06:41.470
I'll report him to the police and have him arrested.

06:42.120 --> 06:44.090
The problem is it's hard to gather evidence.

06:44.310 --> 06:46.070
Didn't you find the photo album?

06:46.110 --> 06:47.190
Hand it over to the police.

06:47.560 --> 06:48.880
Those are just photos of people in underwear.

06:48.900 --> 06:50.500
It's all over the internet.

06:50.530 --> 06:51.800
It's not like they're nudes.

06:53.430 --> 06:55.070
But he forced me to drink with people.

06:55.510 --> 06:57.060
But it didn't happen, right?

06:57.640 --> 06:59.570
Even if you report it, there's no evidence.

07:00.640 --> 07:04.200
The key is, I'm worried if this gets blown out of proportion,

07:04.230 --> 07:05.610
it could damage your reputation.

07:05.700 --> 07:07.010
As rumors spread,

07:07.050 --> 07:08.670
who knows what they might turn into?

07:09.180 --> 07:09.860
Fenghua,

07:10.560 --> 07:12.150
money can be earned again,

07:12.290 --> 07:13.860
but I don't want you

07:13.880 --> 07:15.660
to be in any more trouble in the future.

07:16.510 --> 07:18.600
I can't just let this go.

07:18.660 --> 07:20.610
If you don't return the money, he'll come after you.

07:20.900 --> 07:21.900
Let him come.

07:21.910 --> 07:24.180
If he dares to come, I'll fight him to the death.

07:28.140 --> 07:29.230
How about this?

07:29.460 --> 07:31.270
If he comes, you tell him

07:31.290 --> 07:32.840
to apologize to me sincerely.

07:32.870 --> 07:33.740
Otherwise, he doesn't get his money.

07:33.780 --> 07:35.060
Is that okay?

07:36.670 --> 07:37.470
All right.

07:38.140 --> 07:39.460
If he really dares to come,

07:39.870 --> 07:41.070
it won't be your fight.

07:41.090 --> 07:42.220
That's my business.

07:48.470 --> 07:49.320
I...

07:50.780 --> 07:52.350
What? Let's go.

07:52.960 --> 07:54.470
We're almost home.

07:54.810 --> 07:55.870
You should head back.

07:56.260 --> 07:57.380
I'm going to Beijing.

08:00.680 --> 08:01.810
Going to Beijing?

08:03.150 --> 08:04.420
I told you before,

08:04.710 --> 08:05.810
I'm going to start a business.

08:06.680 --> 08:07.860
Go back and tell my parents

08:07.860 --> 08:09.030
not to worry.

08:09.150 --> 08:10.770
This time, I'm sure I'll succeed.

08:10.980 --> 08:12.030
How long will you be gone?

08:13.470 --> 08:14.500
It's hard to say.

08:14.800 --> 08:16.260
I'll come back when I succeed.

08:16.920 --> 08:18.160
Are you crazy?

08:18.190 --> 08:20.010
Do your parents know about this?

08:20.030 --> 08:22.000
I'm acting first and reporting later.

08:22.010 --> 08:23.260
They wouldn't agree to me going.

08:23.300 --> 08:25.460
Then why are you bothering with this?

08:25.980 --> 08:27.590
Do you think I can succeed?

08:27.930 --> 08:28.630
You can.

08:28.630 --> 08:30.140
Then save your breath.

08:33.220 --> 08:33.980
Fenghua.

08:34.909 --> 08:36.780
I'll buy you a car when I come back.

08:54.870 --> 08:55.780
Here you go.

08:56.090 --> 08:57.310
Be careful.

09:09.630 --> 09:11.070
Okay, we are departing.

09:11.070 --> 09:13.080
Fasten your seatbelt.

09:25.570 --> 09:30.010
[Jixiang Passanger Transport Co., Ltd.]

09:48.430 --> 09:49.030
What?

09:49.120 --> 09:50.440
Your son skipped school

09:50.440 --> 09:51.500
and went to Beijing!

09:51.500 --> 09:53.110
It's a leave of absence.

09:54.670 --> 09:55.190
He went what?

10:01.480 --> 10:02.170
What...

10:02.190 --> 10:04.230
What did he go to Beijing for?

10:06.830 --> 10:08.010
To start a business.

10:09.290 --> 10:10.240
Start a business my ass!

10:10.660 --> 10:11.510
Start a business?

10:12.780 --> 10:13.320
Go, go, go.

10:13.320 --> 10:14.550
Go get Haikuo

10:14.550 --> 10:15.500
and Xingchi here.

10:19.790 --> 10:20.750
He's got some nerve.

10:20.790 --> 10:22.310
Leaving without saying a word.

10:24.390 --> 10:27.050
It's all because you've spoiled him.

10:27.360 --> 10:29.120
What do you mean I've spoiled him?

10:29.170 --> 10:29.990
I'm the one who spoiled him then?

10:30.030 --> 10:30.950
All right, all right, enough.

10:30.950 --> 10:32.030
I'll beat him when he gets back this time.

10:32.050 --> 10:33.170
Don't try to stop me.

10:33.720 --> 10:34.610
I won't stop you.

10:34.910 --> 10:35.670
Beat him to death.

10:35.670 --> 10:36.870
If you cripple him, I'll take care of him.

10:37.020 --> 10:38.090
Seriously.

10:38.770 --> 10:39.680
Your son.

10:42.430 --> 10:43.520
Where are we going?

10:43.550 --> 10:44.680
Here.

10:53.550 --> 10:55.690
Uncle, Auntie.

10:57.790 --> 10:59.890
You all know that Wanghe went to Beijing, right?

10:59.950 --> 11:00.430
I don't.

11:00.430 --> 11:01.190
Yes.

11:03.850 --> 11:04.800
I don't.

11:07.040 --> 11:08.750
You've all conspired together, haven't you?

11:13.410 --> 11:14.360
Uncle,

11:15.250 --> 11:18.200
Wanghe went to Beijing for something important.

11:18.390 --> 11:19.460
You are students.

11:20.030 --> 11:22.050
The important thing you have now is to study.

11:22.350 --> 11:23.670
Skipping school in 12th Grade,

11:23.700 --> 11:24.940
does he have a death wish?

11:26.830 --> 11:30.570
Fenghua said he went to Beijing to start a business.

11:30.590 --> 11:31.470
What kind of business?

11:32.110 --> 11:33.030
What is he thinking?

11:33.050 --> 11:33.990
What do you two know?

11:34.030 --> 11:35.530
Tell us.

11:38.850 --> 11:39.890
You want to

11:39.920 --> 11:41.150
keep it a secret for him?

11:42.200 --> 11:43.360
Speak up!

11:43.750 --> 11:44.950
You think if you don't tell me now,

11:44.950 --> 11:46.360
I won't find out later?

11:47.480 --> 11:48.570
Um, Uncle,

11:48.950 --> 11:50.320
I promise you

11:50.340 --> 11:51.910
this business plan

11:52.470 --> 11:53.540
can benefit

11:53.540 --> 11:54.950
all middle school students across the country.

11:54.950 --> 11:56.030
We firmly believe

11:56.200 --> 11:57.700
he will definitely succeed.

12:01.340 --> 12:03.300
Do you know this old saying

12:03.320 --> 12:07.110
that goes, "Failure is the mother of success"?

12:07.850 --> 12:09.220
For your success,

12:09.240 --> 12:10.270
I'll show you

12:10.310 --> 12:11.980
what failure is.

12:13.520 --> 12:15.680
Why are you hitting someone else's child?

12:16.270 --> 12:17.500
What are you doing?

12:17.630 --> 12:19.870
What are you hitting someone else's child for?

12:21.050 --> 12:21.850
Are you all right?

12:25.180 --> 12:26.470
Darn brat.

12:27.610 --> 12:31.170
♫Cheers, the heroic warriors♫

12:27.830 --> 12:28.590
What are you doing?

12:28.590 --> 12:30.770
What? You don't know what?

12:31.030 --> 12:32.230
Let's just talk.

12:31.710 --> 12:35.510
♫Please accept my sincere congratulation♫

12:32.270 --> 12:33.150
Why pick that up?

12:33.190 --> 12:33.790
No, no, no!

12:33.790 --> 12:34.550
Dad, Dad, Dad!

12:34.550 --> 12:35.130
Don't "no" me.

12:35.190 --> 12:36.010
Let me tell you,

12:36.010 --> 12:37.670
beating you is the least I could do.

12:36.090 --> 12:39.600
♫Because of bullfighters and warriors♫

12:37.670 --> 12:38.190
No, no!

12:38.190 --> 12:40.070
Why are you hitting me for Wanghe skipping school?

12:40.070 --> 12:41.950
If I don't beat you, you'll be out of control.

12:40.790 --> 12:44.470
♫We all get happiness from fighting♫

12:41.950 --> 12:44.150
You should focus on studying!

12:44.150 --> 12:46.010
You'll have to support him when he grows up.

12:44.980 --> 12:48.710
♫Today is a festival♫

12:49.540 --> 12:52.930
♫The bullfighting arena is filled with audience♫

12:53.660 --> 12:57.690
♫Look how passionate they are♫

12:58.380 --> 13:03.690
♫They can't help shouting♫

13:00.660 --> 13:01.310
Let me take a look.

13:03.390 --> 13:05.950
It's not too bad. It should be gone by tomorrow.

13:05.950 --> 13:07.110
My face is fine.

13:07.150 --> 13:08.430
It's mainly my legs.

13:08.430 --> 13:10.900
Look at this, and my buttocks too.

13:11.090 --> 13:12.860
I won't show you two my buttocks though.

13:13.080 --> 13:14.710
Did your dad kick you?

13:15.480 --> 13:16.670
He whipped me with a belt.

13:16.670 --> 13:18.420
So he's learned to use a belt now.

13:19.650 --> 13:21.170
He's picked up bad habits from Uncle Xie.

13:21.200 --> 13:22.560
When Wanghe comes back,

13:22.590 --> 13:24.030
Xingchi and I will give him a good thrashing.

13:24.060 --> 13:24.940
We'll beat him to within an inch of his life.

13:26.870 --> 13:28.040
I'm going to check on Xingchi.

13:40.780 --> 13:42.220
What are you laughing at? Stop laughing.

13:44.670 --> 13:47.030
♫Welcome to Beijing♫

13:47.480 --> 13:50.380
♫Open up the world for you♫

13:50.970 --> 13:56.830
♫The charm in the flow is full of vitality♫

13:51.830 --> 13:52.870
[Hailong Building]

13:52.950 --> 13:54.290
[Zhongguancun e-World]

13:57.530 --> 13:59.790
♫Welcome to Beijing♫

14:00.470 --> 14:03.110
♫Breathe together under the sun♫

14:01.710 --> 14:04.150
$50 million is not enough for anything.

14:03.560 --> 14:09.620
♫Achieve new things on this yellow land♫

14:04.390 --> 14:05.940
Wouldn't that burn through in just one round?

14:06.110 --> 14:07.550
Wait. Listen to me.

14:07.550 --> 14:08.430
Tell them

14:08.460 --> 14:10.410
anything less than a hundred million is not worth discussing.

14:10.180 --> 14:12.820
♫My door is always open♫

14:12.980 --> 14:13.590
Hello.

14:13.130 --> 14:15.850
♫Accepting the world♫

14:13.590 --> 14:13.910
Hello.

14:13.910 --> 14:15.590
How do I get to Fumao Building?

14:15.790 --> 14:16.870
Turn left ahead.

14:16.530 --> 14:18.740
♫Time blooms and youth smiles♫

14:16.870 --> 14:18.710
The tallest building there is it.

14:18.860 --> 14:19.710
Okay, thank you.

14:19.190 --> 14:21.830
♫Welcoming this day♫

14:19.710 --> 14:20.510
No problem.

14:22.040 --> 14:24.040
[North Haidian Bridge]

14:22.880 --> 14:24.990
♫We're all friends♫

14:25.820 --> 14:28.080
♫Please don't be shy♫

14:28.200 --> 14:29.590
In 2008,

14:28.560 --> 14:30.740
♫A bright smile♫

14:29.590 --> 14:32.510
the world will focus on Beijing.

14:31.370 --> 14:33.310
♫Waiting for you♫

14:32.510 --> 14:35.310
A hall that symbolizes hope and dream

14:33.880 --> 14:36.050
♫Welcome to Beijing♫

14:35.310 --> 14:36.670
is being erected

14:36.570 --> 14:39.050
♫Touching you like music♫

14:36.670 --> 14:38.550
on this ancient yet

14:38.550 --> 14:39.910
energetic land.

14:39.760 --> 14:45.680
♫Let's try our best to surpass ourselves♫

14:46.390 --> 14:47.990
♫Welcome to Beijing♫

14:48.460 --> 14:51.330
[Fumao Technology]

14:48.640 --> 14:51.340
♫Anyone who has dreams is amazing♫

14:50.790 --> 14:51.500
Hello.

14:51.740 --> 14:53.650
I'd like to rent a server.

14:51.980 --> 14:57.940
♫There will be miracles if you have courage♫

14:54.210 --> 14:55.690
Where do I complete the paperwork?

14:56.060 --> 14:56.710
I have a reservation.

14:56.720 --> 14:57.900
My name is Xie Wanghe.

15:01.090 --> 15:02.420
In the micro-client area.

15:05.710 --> 15:06.840
There happens to be a vacancy.

15:06.870 --> 15:07.850
Thank you.

15:10.050 --> 15:11.310
Our server service

15:11.310 --> 15:12.720
can handle ten million users without any issues.

15:12.720 --> 15:13.600
Even fifty million users won't be a problem.

15:13.600 --> 15:14.550
For your scale,

15:14.550 --> 15:17.190
you'll need at least a hundred servers to meet the demand.

15:17.190 --> 15:19.140
Of course, it depends on what you think.

15:19.440 --> 15:20.270
What do you think?

15:20.320 --> 15:21.670
No problem, let's start with a hundred servers.

15:21.670 --> 15:22.870
We can always add more if needed later.

15:22.910 --> 15:23.370
All right,

15:23.370 --> 15:24.680
we'll set up a hundred servers for you then.

15:24.550 --> 15:28.220
[Fumao Technology]

15:24.790 --> 15:26.730
Let me know if you need anything else.

16:00.310 --> 16:01.560
Hello.

16:06.470 --> 16:07.710
How can I help you?

16:09.950 --> 16:10.670
Hello.

16:11.700 --> 16:12.690
I'd like to rent a server.

16:15.270 --> 16:16.160
That's such a small capacity.

16:16.390 --> 16:17.380
That's not enough for anything.

16:17.860 --> 16:18.860
A personal website?

16:18.900 --> 16:20.220
it's for personal use at the moment.

16:20.580 --> 16:24.100
I'll need to expand capacity when the scale grows.

16:24.130 --> 16:25.760
Why don't you share one with others?

16:25.800 --> 16:27.020
Several people can use one server together.

16:27.090 --> 16:27.990
You can split the annual fee.

16:28.020 --> 16:28.950
That won't work.

16:29.060 --> 16:30.690
There's no guarantee for data security.

16:32.990 --> 16:34.940
Do you usually live in Beijing?

16:35.090 --> 16:36.080
I'm in Honghuai.

16:38.070 --> 16:39.360
Honghuai...

16:43.540 --> 16:44.790
Insufficient funds.

16:45.550 --> 16:46.580
How about this?

16:46.810 --> 16:48.380
You could get a domestic server.

16:48.870 --> 16:50.070
Although...

16:50.370 --> 16:52.340
the configuration is lower, but the price is cheaper.

16:52.710 --> 16:55.170
It's just that the maintenance and migration costs afterwards

16:55.270 --> 16:57.410
might be more expensive than foreign servers.

16:58.830 --> 16:59.860
The maintenance fee is calculated separately.

17:01.270 --> 17:02.990
All right, it's sufficient for now.

17:03.430 --> 17:05.900
Um, can I see the server room?

17:08.480 --> 17:09.109
Sure.

17:09.300 --> 17:10.180
ID card.

17:18.569 --> 17:19.050
[Name: Xie Wanghe]

17:19.940 --> 17:21.099
[Pass]

17:38.190 --> 17:39.190
Come here.

17:47.280 --> 17:49.160
The third one in the second to last group of servers.

17:49.260 --> 17:51.320
Their website just shut down.

17:51.350 --> 17:52.190
It's used.

17:52.190 --> 17:52.950
About a year old.

17:52.950 --> 17:54.420
But the performance is fine.

18:01.630 --> 18:02.550
Hurry up, hurry up.

18:03.250 --> 18:04.270
Hello, teacher.

18:04.660 --> 18:06.030
What did Xie Wanghe go to Beijing for?

18:10.470 --> 18:11.260
What's he up to?

18:11.310 --> 18:12.150
Are you performing a choir performance?

18:12.360 --> 18:13.380
You won't tell me, huh?

18:13.760 --> 18:14.850
None of you will say anything, right?

18:14.940 --> 18:15.630
Fine then.

18:15.660 --> 18:17.590
This matter has now become serious.

18:17.620 --> 18:19.540
Expulsion from school is not out of the question.

18:19.540 --> 18:20.710
I'm going to the principal right now.

18:20.730 --> 18:21.150
Don't, don't!

18:21.150 --> 18:22.030
Mr. Xu!

18:24.730 --> 18:25.910
He went to...

18:26.820 --> 18:27.960
rent a server.

18:28.180 --> 18:29.260
What did you say?

18:33.100 --> 18:34.520
Wanghe wants to set up an online–

18:35.350 --> 18:36.250
Teacher,

18:36.610 --> 18:37.910
Wanghe will only be gone for a few days.

18:37.950 --> 18:39.190
He'll be back soon.

18:39.310 --> 18:40.070
Don't worry.

18:40.100 --> 18:42.060
It's a good thing he's not doing anything bad this time.

18:42.100 --> 18:43.450
If this project really succeeds,

18:43.590 --> 18:44.550
not just our school,

18:44.590 --> 18:46.230
the whole Honghuai area could benefit from it.

18:46.250 --> 18:47.010
You're just blowing hot air.

18:47.030 --> 18:48.430
Don't I know him well enough?

18:48.430 --> 18:50.210
He's always got big ideas but no skills to back them up.

18:50.310 --> 18:51.510
He's got plenty of ideas,

18:51.540 --> 18:52.870
but what can he actually do well?

18:52.910 --> 18:53.670
If he becomes the CEO

18:53.670 --> 18:54.770
of that website,

18:55.100 --> 18:57.010
he'd run it into the ground in less than six months.

19:00.350 --> 19:01.090
You,

19:01.630 --> 19:03.610
go to Xie Wanghe's house tonight.

19:03.830 --> 19:05.850
Have his parents write an excuse note.

19:06.110 --> 19:06.980
The reason

19:07.620 --> 19:09.050
absolutely cannot be "starting a business."

19:09.070 --> 19:10.540
Otherwise, I won't be able to cover for him.

19:11.110 --> 19:11.630
All right,

19:11.670 --> 19:12.290
we'll get it done tonight

19:12.390 --> 19:13.150
and submit it first thing in the morning.

19:13.150 --> 19:14.210
Thank you, Mr. Xu.

19:14.630 --> 19:15.150
Thank you, teacher.

19:15.150 --> 19:16.830
Okay, okay, hurry back now.

19:17.450 --> 19:18.470
Quick, quick, quick.

19:22.580 --> 19:23.940
Thank you, Mr. Xu.

19:27.060 --> 19:27.950
Keep your mouth shut.

19:34.990 --> 19:36.690
Let's think about the reason for taking leave.

19:38.710 --> 19:39.780
His grandmother is critically ill.

19:39.830 --> 19:40.430
He's accompanying him.

19:41.990 --> 19:43.450
Didn't his grandmother already pass away?

19:43.780 --> 19:44.950
The school doesn't know that.

19:45.430 --> 19:46.650
This won't work.

19:47.630 --> 19:50.140
It'll be more troublesome if someone reports him later.

19:50.270 --> 19:51.350
Let's think again.

19:51.720 --> 19:53.670
Think of a reason that the school can accept.

19:55.430 --> 19:56.110
I've got one.

19:57.200 --> 19:58.520
Let's say Xie Wanghe has a brain tumor.

19:58.550 --> 19:59.630
He needs to go to Beijing for surgery.

19:59.660 --> 20:01.420
You're the one with a brain tumor! Your whole family has brain tumors!

20:01.470 --> 20:02.510
I was just kidding.

20:02.510 --> 20:03.510
I'm warning you.

20:03.510 --> 20:05.470
We're talking about serious matters here. Don't be an idiot.

20:06.230 --> 20:08.510
I just don't understand. With Xie Wanghe's brain,

20:08.510 --> 20:10.380
he can't even figure out basic arithmetic.

20:10.430 --> 20:12.030
Who gave him the confidence to start a business?

20:12.030 --> 20:14.150
Even your dad can start a business with his brain.

20:14.890 --> 20:15.720
What did you say?

20:15.830 --> 20:16.980
Say that again!

20:18.370 --> 20:19.120
Ouch, ouch!

20:19.220 --> 20:20.940
Fenghua, let go. Let go, let go.

20:21.110 --> 20:21.780
It hurts.

20:22.070 --> 20:28.320
[Striving unceasingly with unwavering resolve]

20:23.520 --> 20:25.290
Wanghe went to take care of important business.

20:25.670 --> 20:26.610
If he succeeds,

20:26.800 --> 20:28.370
everyone will benefit.

20:28.410 --> 20:30.620
He'll explain the details when he returns.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.730
But before that,

20:32.750 --> 20:34.920
if anyone dares to snitch behind our backs,

20:34.950 --> 20:36.370
and I find out about it,

20:37.570 --> 20:38.990
they'll face the consequences.

20:43.530 --> 20:45.020
If you have issues with Wanghe,

20:45.040 --> 20:47.070
confront him face to face.

20:47.110 --> 20:48.450
Don't gossip behind his back.

20:48.590 --> 20:49.500
It's not manly.

20:50.560 --> 20:51.660
You're right.

20:51.820 --> 20:53.320
I'm indeed not manly enough.

20:53.350 --> 20:56.170
The manliest one must be your Wanghe.

20:56.870 --> 20:58.070
[Striving unceasingly with unwavering resolve]

21:01.990 --> 21:03.490
Who poured ink on my shoes?

21:03.560 --> 21:04.940
My new shoes!

21:05.610 --> 21:06.510
Was it you?

21:08.380 --> 21:09.180
Fenghua!

21:09.200 --> 21:11.180
I was talking about him, not you.

21:14.210 --> 21:16.170
My... My dad bought me new shoes.

21:16.620 --> 21:17.870
Fenghua, let me tell you,

21:17.870 --> 21:18.840
this thing today, between us two...

21:21.590 --> 21:23.470
It's still our Fenghua who's the best.

21:23.700 --> 21:25.360
Fenghua is awesome!

21:25.800 --> 21:27.690
Everyone, be quiet. It's self-study time.

21:26.660 --> 21:30.940
[Striving unceasingly with unwavering resolve]

21:27.890 --> 21:29.350
Even if you aren't studying, there are people who are.

21:29.890 --> 21:30.880
What are you doing?

21:32.850 --> 21:34.350
Get back to studying, come on!

21:37.320 --> 21:38.550
I've thought of a reason.

21:41.160 --> 21:42.280
For an exhibition?

21:43.580 --> 21:44.530
What exhibition?

21:44.560 --> 21:45.690
Canal culture.

21:46.980 --> 21:48.600
I saw it online.

21:48.750 --> 21:49.560
For the World Heritage application,

21:49.590 --> 21:51.150
the province has an exhibition in Beijing

21:51.170 --> 21:52.190
for these few days.

21:52.280 --> 21:54.240
But he can't just skip school to go for it.

21:54.500 --> 21:55.950
It doesn't make sense.

21:56.670 --> 21:57.310
It's fine.

21:57.470 --> 21:59.850
I'll ask Haikuo to write an essay later.

22:00.050 --> 22:01.720
Then I'll have Grandpa Zhou help revise it.

22:01.720 --> 22:03.520
We're all from By the Canal.

22:03.870 --> 22:05.090
This school

22:05.190 --> 22:07.150
is very supportive of historical

22:07.180 --> 22:08.350
and cultural activities.

22:11.510 --> 22:12.510
Is this appropriate?

22:13.950 --> 22:15.950
The teacher didn't want to give him a hard time.

22:16.110 --> 22:17.750
Otherwise, he could have been expelled.

22:20.530 --> 22:21.480
All right then.

22:21.570 --> 22:22.770
So for this matter,

22:22.990 --> 22:24.350
keep a close eye on it, will you?

22:26.750 --> 22:27.940
It's driving me crazy.

22:28.700 --> 22:29.930
Just wait until he comes back.

22:30.430 --> 22:32.040
I'll teach him a lesson when he returns.

22:33.750 --> 22:35.220
Why do you need to punish him?

22:37.090 --> 22:38.250
He skipped school.

22:38.510 --> 22:40.380
Is this what a student should do?

22:44.280 --> 22:45.080
Ms. Liang.

22:45.430 --> 22:47.130
You mustn't think that way.

22:47.170 --> 22:49.470
Wanghe went to Beijing for something important.

22:49.510 --> 22:50.900
We should all support him.

22:51.100 --> 22:53.020
He can only fool you.

22:53.110 --> 22:54.750
You're the only one who believes him.

22:57.950 --> 23:00.990
Silly girl, you need to wise up.

23:01.020 --> 23:03.220
Don't end up being sold by him

23:03.250 --> 23:04.720
yet you have to count the money for him.

23:08.000 --> 23:08.800
Bastard!

23:25.200 --> 23:32.600
[Breakfast]

23:27.070 --> 23:27.600
Let me...

23:27.630 --> 23:28.310
-Let me do it.
-Move it...

23:29.670 --> 23:31.120
One, two, three.

23:34.070 --> 23:35.840
You two are here so early.

23:35.870 --> 23:36.750
Good morning.

23:37.190 --> 23:38.240
Take it easy.

23:38.270 --> 23:39.350
How's your back?

23:39.370 --> 23:40.550
Be careful.

23:40.900 --> 23:41.470
It's fine, it's fine.

23:41.470 --> 23:42.270
Come this way.

23:42.350 --> 23:43.350
I'm not that delicate.

23:43.690 --> 23:45.020
But I still don't dare

23:45.060 --> 23:46.280
to lift heavy things.

23:46.340 --> 23:46.950
You

23:46.950 --> 23:48.780
shouldn't all the heavy work yourself.

23:48.810 --> 23:51.140
Let your Xingchi do it.

23:51.150 --> 23:52.990
What's the point of raising such a big son?

23:53.870 --> 23:54.940
Let him do it.

23:55.510 --> 23:56.410
Him?

23:56.450 --> 23:58.380
If he could just take care of himself,

23:56.770 --> 23:59.730
[Breakfast]

23:58.400 --> 23:59.920
I'd wake up from laughing.

24:00.140 --> 24:01.870
Still better than ours.

24:01.890 --> 24:03.650
At least you don't have to worry about his studies.

24:05.240 --> 24:07.100
Ours isn't any better.

24:07.260 --> 24:08.940
It's only because Shao keeps a close eye on him.

24:09.030 --> 24:10.450
Shao said this time,

24:10.480 --> 24:11.740
if he doesn't do well in the exam,

24:11.780 --> 24:13.260
he'll disown him.

24:14.270 --> 24:15.390
I've made threats too,

24:15.430 --> 24:16.400
but it's no use at all.

24:16.420 --> 24:17.750
Fenghua

24:17.830 --> 24:19.160
is just thick-skinned.

24:19.180 --> 24:21.310
She gets sleepy as soon as she picks up a textbook.

24:21.740 --> 24:23.490
Why hasn't Granny Ma arrived yet?

24:24.410 --> 24:25.380
Yeah.

24:26.010 --> 24:27.040
Did she oversleep?

24:29.690 --> 24:37.020
[Clock Fixing]

24:31.320 --> 24:32.800
Ma'am, two youtiao please.

24:33.200 --> 24:33.690
All right!

24:40.230 --> 24:41.310
Do you understand this?

24:41.330 --> 24:42.940
First, calculate this angle.

24:43.280 --> 24:44.600
Then plug it in.

24:47.520 --> 24:48.660
That's it.

24:50.770 --> 24:51.890
How's the studying going?

24:52.530 --> 24:53.070
Mom.

24:53.260 --> 24:54.180
Ms. Gu.

24:55.660 --> 24:56.860
Why so formal?

24:56.900 --> 24:57.800
Call me auntie.

24:58.690 --> 24:59.470
Sit down.

24:59.980 --> 25:01.620
Stop studying and eat.

25:01.690 --> 25:02.590
It's getting cold.

25:12.970 --> 25:15.190
I've hired a tutor for Chen Rui.

25:15.410 --> 25:17.640
He's a first-class teacher in our city.

25:17.680 --> 25:19.060
But he's already retired.

25:19.400 --> 25:20.370
On Saturdays,

25:20.440 --> 25:22.010
he'll come to our house to tutor Chen Rui.

25:22.030 --> 25:24.260
If you're free this weekend,

25:24.300 --> 25:25.300
come for extra classes too.

25:26.360 --> 25:28.530
No need. My grades are okay.

25:28.560 --> 25:29.940
I don't need a tutor for now.

25:34.990 --> 25:36.620
You've helped Chen Rui so much.

25:36.650 --> 25:38.960
I feel I should help you too.

25:39.230 --> 25:41.140
Besides, your grades are so good.

25:41.170 --> 25:42.170
If you push a little harder,

25:42.220 --> 25:44.000
you'll definitely get into a good university.

25:44.710 --> 25:45.930
In this era,

25:45.960 --> 25:47.350
the best way to change your fate

25:47.570 --> 25:49.380
is through the college entrance exam.

25:50.690 --> 25:52.420
I'm not hungry, thank you.

25:56.470 --> 25:57.110
Just agree.

25:57.550 --> 25:58.860
Otherwise, she'll keep pestering you.

26:00.740 --> 26:01.490
Okay.

26:01.510 --> 26:03.000
I'll come every weekend from now on.

26:03.490 --> 26:04.500
Thank you.

26:05.250 --> 26:06.490
Don't be so polite.

26:12.080 --> 26:14.040
If you're not eating, at least have an apple.

26:15.950 --> 26:16.730
Thank you.

26:25.710 --> 26:26.870
Granny Ma!

26:30.010 --> 26:31.040
Granny Ma!

26:32.740 --> 26:33.450
Ma–

26:36.150 --> 26:37.500
G-Granny Ma!

26:39.800 --> 26:40.810
Granny Ma!

26:42.020 --> 26:43.080
Granny Ma, what's wrong?

26:43.100 --> 26:43.910
Let me help you up.

26:43.950 --> 26:45.230
Don't touch me yet.

26:46.060 --> 26:48.210
I just felt dizzy for a moment.

26:48.920 --> 26:50.270
Give me a minute to recover.

26:50.290 --> 26:52.280
Then let me help you up first.

26:58.840 --> 26:59.710
Yanzi!

26:59.740 --> 27:00.490
Yuling!

27:00.520 --> 27:01.310
Hurry, hurry!

27:01.340 --> 27:02.500
Granny Ma is sick!

27:02.530 --> 27:03.060
Hurry, hurry!

27:03.080 --> 27:03.620
Granny Ma?

27:03.670 --> 27:04.360
Come quickly!

27:04.710 --> 27:05.630
You're not doing business anymore?

27:05.650 --> 27:07.000
Take the things yourself!

27:08.690 --> 27:10.410
Granny Ma! We're here.

27:10.420 --> 27:11.280
We're taking you to the hospital.

27:11.300 --> 27:12.030
Yanzi!

27:12.130 --> 27:13.600
Get the stretcher ready. Bring it quickly!

27:13.670 --> 27:15.250
Yes, yes, yes. The stretcher, the stretcher.

27:16.080 --> 27:17.030
The stretcher is here.

27:17.050 --> 27:18.660
What if the three of us can't lift her?

27:19.200 --> 27:20.670
I'll go find Mr. Zhou for help.

27:20.970 --> 27:21.630
Okay.

27:21.630 --> 27:22.830
Get everything ready for the hospital!

27:22.830 --> 27:23.630
All right! All right!

27:23.670 --> 27:24.350
The stretcher is here.

27:24.350 --> 27:25.700
I'm going to find Mr. Zhou.

27:26.230 --> 27:26.910
You watch her.

27:26.930 --> 27:28.140
I'll go pack the things.

27:30.680 --> 27:31.790
Mr. Zhou!

27:32.150 --> 27:33.320
Mr. ZHou!

27:34.250 --> 27:35.050
What?

27:35.920 --> 27:36.900
Siyi...

27:37.510 --> 27:38.120
Siyi!

27:38.140 --> 27:39.760
Don't worry, we're here for you.

27:40.190 --> 27:41.680
Look, they're here, they're here.

27:41.720 --> 27:42.720
Come on, come on.

27:42.740 --> 27:43.950
Turn that stretcher around.

27:43.980 --> 27:45.350
Turn it this way. Come on, come on.

27:45.370 --> 27:47.230
One, two, go.

27:47.710 --> 27:48.350
Exert some strength.

27:48.390 --> 27:49.390
Slow down, slow down.

27:49.430 --> 27:49.830
Here.

27:49.870 --> 27:51.030
Put your hands down, put your hands down.

27:51.050 --> 27:51.990
Give me a hand.

27:51.990 --> 27:52.430
Come on, come on.

27:52.430 --> 27:53.140
One.

27:53.730 --> 27:54.270
Careful.

27:54.270 --> 27:54.870
All right.

27:54.920 --> 27:55.600
Three!

27:56.680 --> 27:57.270
Let's go.

27:57.270 --> 27:57.630
Yuling.

27:57.630 --> 27:58.510
Go get the things.

27:58.510 --> 27:59.040
Okay!

27:59.130 --> 27:59.590
Hurry.

27:59.630 --> 28:00.390
Watch out for the steps.

28:00.390 --> 28:00.950
Slow down, be careful.

28:00.950 --> 28:02.540
Slow down, slow down.

28:02.630 --> 28:03.190
Be careful.

28:03.190 --> 28:04.270
Slow down, slow down.

28:06.070 --> 28:07.540
Yuling, take over for me for a moment.

28:07.830 --> 28:08.390
Okay.

28:08.840 --> 28:09.610
What's wrong?

28:09.830 --> 28:10.670
You guys go ahead.

28:10.670 --> 28:11.180
Where are you going?

28:11.180 --> 28:12.200
I'll be right there. I'm just grabbing some things.

28:12.200 --> 28:12.910
All right, let's go, let's go.

28:12.910 --> 28:13.670
Go ahead, go ahead.

28:40.230 --> 28:41.270
Siyi.

28:44.800 --> 28:46.010
What are you doing here?

29:03.270 --> 29:04.310
Grandma.

29:06.390 --> 29:07.880
Grandma, what's wrong? Grandma.

29:08.350 --> 29:11.720
Siyi, I'm... I'm fine.

29:12.540 --> 29:13.900
I'm not dead yet.

29:13.940 --> 29:14.740
It's nothing.

29:14.860 --> 29:16.920
Why is my grandma suddenly hospitalized?

29:17.490 --> 29:18.620
What's the illness?

29:18.630 --> 29:20.120
It's a cerebral thrombosis.

29:20.640 --> 29:22.000
But the treatment was timely.

29:22.520 --> 29:24.600
The doctor said she should recover with proper care.

29:25.440 --> 29:26.610
Oh, child.

29:26.640 --> 29:28.730
Don't cry, don't cry, don't cry.

29:29.900 --> 29:30.720
That's enough.

29:31.230 --> 29:33.340
You see, normally you seem so...

29:33.570 --> 29:34.720
strong.

29:35.320 --> 29:37.760
Why do you panic when something happens?

29:37.800 --> 29:39.030
Don't panic.

29:51.930 --> 29:53.770
Granny Ma's illness...

29:54.370 --> 29:55.540
Fortunately

29:56.030 --> 29:57.630
the rescue was timely this time.

29:58.350 --> 29:59.230
Moreover,

29:59.490 --> 30:01.400
recovery will also take some time.

30:01.950 --> 30:03.400
So I think

30:03.860 --> 30:05.560
she can't be left alone.

30:05.580 --> 30:06.890
That's not a problem.

30:07.250 --> 30:08.470
Our neighborhood has nothing

30:08.510 --> 30:09.270
but plenty of people.

30:09.290 --> 30:10.050
Exactly.

30:10.080 --> 30:12.040
Let's discuss and arrange a schedule later.

30:12.710 --> 30:14.040
Our families can take turns.

30:14.230 --> 30:14.950
Don't worry.

30:14.950 --> 30:16.030
You should hurry back to your busy store.

30:16.030 --> 30:16.980
Go quickly.

30:17.190 --> 30:18.110
We're here.

30:18.150 --> 30:18.910
Rest assured, rest assured.

30:19.010 --> 30:19.950
Go, go, go.

30:19.950 --> 30:20.620
Hurry up.

30:26.590 --> 30:28.430
Let Siyi stay at your place tonight.

30:28.430 --> 30:29.270
With Fenghua there,

30:29.270 --> 30:30.740
she'll feel more at ease.

30:30.760 --> 30:31.990
They'll have each other for company.

30:32.190 --> 30:33.950
I just need to remind Fenghua.

30:33.950 --> 30:35.930
She tends to speak without thinking.

30:37.000 --> 30:38.360
I've already paid the hospital fees,

30:38.380 --> 30:40.330
but I'm not sure how much it will cost this time.

30:41.350 --> 30:42.390
Granny Ma.

30:42.650 --> 30:43.570
be able to afford it?

30:43.600 --> 30:45.040
Definitely not.

30:45.070 --> 30:46.210
We will

30:46.250 --> 30:48.010
help cover the costs for now.

30:48.140 --> 30:49.980
We can consider it as prepaid rent.

30:50.030 --> 30:50.390
All right.

30:50.390 --> 30:50.670
Granny.

30:50.670 --> 30:51.550
Then it's settled.

30:51.570 --> 30:52.930
What would you like to eat?

30:52.970 --> 30:54.020
I'll make it for you.

30:54.190 --> 30:54.880
No need,

30:56.190 --> 30:58.870
Ms. Liang and Ms. Yan are here.

30:59.190 --> 31:01.320
You don't have to do this.

31:01.390 --> 31:02.950
I'm already 17 years old.

31:02.950 --> 31:04.730
Stop treating me like a child.

31:04.820 --> 31:07.300
In ancient times, I could have been married with children by now.

31:09.390 --> 31:10.590
That's true.

31:12.070 --> 31:14.430
When I gave birth to your father,

31:15.400 --> 31:16.940
I was 18.

31:18.190 --> 31:19.950
When your mother had you,

31:19.980 --> 31:21.570
she was 20.

31:22.150 --> 31:24.900
You know, when you were just born,

31:25.910 --> 31:28.680
you were as small as a kitten.

31:28.810 --> 31:30.100
So tiny,

31:30.940 --> 31:34.260
with big, watery eyes.

31:34.390 --> 31:35.950
You were so beautiful.

31:36.830 --> 31:39.260
I was so fond of you.

31:40.230 --> 31:41.070
But you know,

31:41.740 --> 31:43.790
I was afraid to hold you.

31:43.830 --> 31:45.350
My hands and feet are rough,

31:45.390 --> 31:47.450
I was worried I might hurt you.

31:47.490 --> 31:50.040
When I have children in the future, I'll let you hold them.

31:51.170 --> 31:52.900
You'll let me hold them?

31:52.950 --> 31:55.910
Grandma, I'm scared.

31:56.250 --> 31:57.570
Don't be afraid.

31:58.360 --> 32:00.520
See? I'm fine, aren't I?

32:00.670 --> 32:02.190
It'll be better in a couple of days.

32:02.220 --> 32:04.200
The family wasn't well-off to begin with.

32:05.190 --> 32:06.270
Siyi would need money

32:06.270 --> 32:08.070
for college.

32:08.390 --> 32:09.430
And now with this illness...

32:13.470 --> 32:14.800
This child, Siyi,

32:15.350 --> 32:16.600
has really been through a lot.

32:16.630 --> 32:18.910
Don't be afraid, Siyi.

33:18.150 --> 33:20.520
♫When the moon hangs in the sky♫

33:20.180 --> 33:21.390
My mom made some black chicken soup.

33:21.110 --> 33:22.940
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

33:21.410 --> 33:22.200
Want some?

33:23.320 --> 33:25.210
I've already eaten at the hospital.

33:23.480 --> 33:26.320
♫Who is still by your side?♫

33:25.470 --> 33:27.310
Cut the crap. Come with me.

33:27.660 --> 33:29.210
I haven't finished my homework yet.

33:27.990 --> 33:31.670
♫As time passes♫

33:29.310 --> 33:30.350
Do it at my place.

33:30.900 --> 33:31.880
Stay with me tonight.

33:31.910 --> 33:33.230
I'll give you a 200 yuan tip.

33:32.500 --> 33:36.310
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

33:35.780 --> 33:36.990
What are you standing there for?

33:39.280 --> 33:43.340
♫When youthful company fades, leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

33:39.900 --> 33:40.430
Let's go.

33:43.800 --> 33:47.430
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

33:44.300 --> 33:51.810
[Families along the canal]

33:44.350 --> 33:45.430
Granny Ma's illness

33:45.430 --> 33:47.710
will only get worse in the future.

33:48.170 --> 33:49.930
She definitely can't run her business anymore.

33:48.910 --> 33:52.840
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

33:49.950 --> 33:51.440
She still has a child to raise at home.

33:52.350 --> 33:54.070
If it's just about taking care of her,

33:53.800 --> 33:57.500
♫Of sweet dreams♫

33:54.870 --> 33:57.390
every family in our courtyard can lend a hand.

33:57.960 --> 34:00.450
But that's not a long-term solution, is it?

34:00.790 --> 34:03.040
The main issue is Granny Ma's personality.

34:01.770 --> 34:05.070
♫Life is long♫

34:03.870 --> 34:05.340
If we keep helping her like this,

34:05.590 --> 34:06.910
she definitely won't be able to accept it.

34:06.430 --> 34:09.940
♫No need to dwell♫

34:09.110 --> 34:11.030
So let's think.

34:10.969 --> 34:14.260
♫Like moonlight♫

34:11.070 --> 34:12.710
Is there any other way we can help?

34:14.110 --> 34:16.270
We're renting Granny Ma's house.

34:15.639 --> 34:19.239
♫Don't forget♫

34:16.310 --> 34:18.830
Starting this month, we plan to increase the rent by 100 yuan.

34:19.130 --> 34:20.840
But this small amount of money

34:20.880 --> 34:24.370
♫Life is long♫

34:21.270 --> 34:22.550
is definitely not enough.

34:23.350 --> 34:25.810
Let's think if there are any other solutions.

34:25.130 --> 34:28.580
♫No need to dwell♫

34:26.070 --> 34:28.110
Well, it's definitely up to us few families here.

34:28.110 --> 34:29.350
We can contribute money and effort together

34:29.370 --> 34:30.630
to help them get through this difficult time.

34:29.880 --> 34:33.170
♫Like moonlight♫

34:30.650 --> 34:32.449
I don't think it's appropriate

34:32.510 --> 34:34.530
As Mr. Zhou just mentioned,

34:34.620 --> 34:38.920
♫The old times♫

34:35.020 --> 34:36.550
people always have their pride.

34:36.630 --> 34:37.510
Think about it,

34:37.510 --> 34:39.870
if Granny Ma has to rely on our families' support to live,

34:39.870 --> 34:42.310
how can she hold her head up in this courtyard?

34:39.880 --> 34:42.929
♫Life is long♫

34:44.350 --> 34:47.710
♫No need to dwell♫

34:47.070 --> 34:48.230
I have another idea,

34:48.830 --> 34:52.280
♫Like moonlight♫

34:49.179 --> 34:51.190
but I'm not sure if it's feasible.

34:51.190 --> 34:52.580
Hurry up and tell us.

34:52.989 --> 34:53.870
Well,

34:53.530 --> 34:56.949
♫Don't forget♫

34:53.870 --> 34:56.429
we could apply for a minimum living allowance for Granny Ma.

34:56.460 --> 34:58.610
It's at least a few hundred yuan a month.

34:58.280 --> 35:01.940
♫Life is long♫

34:58.940 --> 35:00.490
Mr. Zhou, do you think it's possible?

35:02.030 --> 35:02.550
I...

35:02.810 --> 35:04.450
I still think it's not appropriate.

35:02.910 --> 35:06.480
♫No need to dwell♫

35:07.650 --> 35:11.150
♫Like moonlight♫

35:07.790 --> 35:09.440
This minimum living allowance

35:09.440 --> 35:11.350
is designed for those who have no means of support,

35:11.350 --> 35:13.510
for these vulnerable groups.

35:12.640 --> 35:16.780
♫The old times♫

35:14.070 --> 35:15.880
Granny Ma still has a house she's renting out.

35:16.020 --> 35:17.630
This doesn't comply with the policy.

35:22.870 --> 35:23.880
Mr. Zhou,

35:24.430 --> 35:25.230
you run a restaurant

35:25.260 --> 35:26.470
and know a lot of people.

35:26.630 --> 35:28.430
Can you look into what Yanzi just suggested

35:28.750 --> 35:29.510
and see if it's possible?

35:30.030 --> 35:31.350
If it's possible, what should we do?

35:31.620 --> 35:32.590
Could you ask around?

35:34.510 --> 35:36.840
It seems Ms. Gu is in charge of this matter.

35:37.280 --> 35:37.950
But

35:39.510 --> 35:40.630
we need someone familiar

35:43.510 --> 35:44.510
to put in a word.

35:54.870 --> 35:56.230
Why are you looking at me?

35:56.870 --> 35:58.490
I'm a colleague of her husband,

35:58.490 --> 35:59.890
but I don't know her personally.

35:59.910 --> 36:02.330
A colleague is fine too, Mr. Shao.

36:02.380 --> 36:04.500
Why don't you take the trouble to go?

36:04.520 --> 36:06.140
As long as District Chief Gu

36:06.160 --> 36:06.990
is willing to come

36:06.990 --> 36:07.760
for a meeting,

36:07.760 --> 36:09.150
we'll take care of the rest.

36:09.170 --> 36:09.550
Okay?

36:09.550 --> 36:10.310
I'm not going.

36:10.330 --> 36:11.760
Whoever wants to go can go.

36:12.070 --> 36:12.910
It's annoying.

36:12.910 --> 36:14.250
I'd rather avoid it if I could.

36:46.710 --> 36:47.450
Chen,

36:48.830 --> 36:51.120
there might have been some misunderstandings between us before.

36:52.590 --> 36:53.600
It's my fault.

36:54.300 --> 36:55.740
I apologize to you.

36:55.990 --> 36:57.050
I'm sorry.

37:05.830 --> 37:06.530
Grandma!

37:09.430 --> 37:10.160
Grandma.

37:10.310 --> 37:10.860
Grandma.

37:10.880 --> 37:11.800
Grandma.

37:12.300 --> 37:13.100
We came to see you.

37:13.100 --> 37:14.570
We've come to visit you.

37:16.110 --> 37:18.260
You've come from so far away.

37:18.690 --> 37:20.160
Please, sit down, sit down.

37:20.310 --> 37:22.250
Siyi, show them to their seats.

37:21.860 --> 37:24.910
♫Stepping on the old time♫

37:23.430 --> 37:24.860
Have you eaten yet?

37:25.130 --> 37:26.280
No, we haven't.

37:25.520 --> 37:29.150
♫The wind blows gently♫

37:26.920 --> 37:28.130
Since you fell ill,

37:28.260 --> 37:30.040
we haven't had any appetite.

37:29.880 --> 37:33.340
♫It blows through the the forest and the city♫

37:30.110 --> 37:31.910
Grandma, don't listen to him.

37:31.910 --> 37:33.530
No appetite? He stole my pork chop at lunch.

37:33.550 --> 37:35.080
I was just worried you couldn't finish it.

37:34.950 --> 37:37.730
♫It blows across your face♫

37:35.110 --> 37:36.790
Hypocritical.

37:38.840 --> 37:41.790
♫And my heart♫

37:39.750 --> 37:40.710
Be careful.

37:40.710 --> 37:41.400
It's alright, it's alright.

37:41.550 --> 37:42.550
Thank you for your hard work.

37:42.550 --> 37:44.190
Ms. Liang, Ms. Yan.

37:43.340 --> 37:46.180
♫The wind blows gently♫

37:44.920 --> 37:46.110
You're back.

37:46.110 --> 37:47.310
How's your grandma?

37:46.930 --> 37:49.480
♫Blowing through summer♫

37:47.310 --> 37:48.110
Much better.

37:48.110 --> 37:49.630
What are you all doing here?

37:49.630 --> 37:50.670
It's such a hassle

37:50.220 --> 37:52.860
♫Blowing through the eaves♫

37:50.870 --> 37:52.690
to install a telephone in your place.

37:53.120 --> 37:54.410
Quick, quick, get inside.

37:53.880 --> 37:55.930
♫Blowing through me♫

37:55.540 --> 37:57.430
Sir, there's sound.

37:56.410 --> 38:00.330
♫Warm love♫

37:57.750 --> 37:59.550
Master Liu, it's done!

37:59.550 --> 38:00.510
Good, good.

38:00.510 --> 38:01.540
Your grandma

38:01.570 --> 38:03.530
wouldn't install a phone previously.

38:01.760 --> 38:03.200
♫After all these years♫

38:03.560 --> 38:05.600
But now times have changed.

38:03.820 --> 38:07.520
♫You have not changed♫

38:05.630 --> 38:07.140
If there's anything,

38:07.180 --> 38:08.660
you can directly let us know with a phone call.

38:08.540 --> 38:10.420
♫After all these years♫

38:08.700 --> 38:09.530
It's convenient.

38:09.980 --> 38:11.330
It's good that it's installed now.

38:11.030 --> 38:14.260
♫How far has the old times♫

38:11.570 --> 38:12.490
This phone, you know,

38:12.510 --> 38:14.370
was covered by Mr. Zhou.

38:15.140 --> 38:16.990
We called the telco

38:15.400 --> 38:17.290
♫We love gone?♫

38:17.020 --> 38:18.430
It was an urgent installation.

38:18.150 --> 38:21.720
♫Lost in a distance♫

38:18.450 --> 38:20.210
I'll go thank Uncle Zhou again.

38:22.330 --> 38:23.740
I almost let it slip.

38:22.380 --> 38:24.450
♫Can't be forgotten♫

38:24.280 --> 38:25.360
Look at me.

38:25.110 --> 38:28.850
♫The first growth♫

38:25.450 --> 38:27.690
Don't let the child worry about it.

38:28.030 --> 38:28.800
Sir.

38:28.960 --> 38:35.690
[Flower Street]

38:29.820 --> 38:30.550
This way.

38:30.550 --> 38:31.190
Ms. Gu,

38:31.510 --> 38:32.380
It's right here.

38:33.670 --> 38:34.470
Take a look.

38:35.860 --> 38:42.760
[Families along the canal]

38:36.250 --> 38:36.830
This...

38:36.860 --> 38:37.510
The one in the middle.

38:37.550 --> 38:37.950
Yes.

38:38.070 --> 38:38.590
This is it.

38:38.590 --> 38:39.670
This is Granny Ma's stall.

38:40.870 --> 38:42.390
She sells radish pancakes, right?

38:42.390 --> 38:42.830
Yes, that's right.

38:43.460 --> 38:44.270
Granny Ma,

38:44.470 --> 38:45.740
you need to use your left hand.

38:45.740 --> 38:46.590
From now on,

38:46.590 --> 38:48.430
let's not use your right hand to eat.

38:48.430 --> 38:50.040
Didn't the doctor just say

38:50.110 --> 38:51.870
using your left hand regularly is good for your health?

38:52.430 --> 38:52.980
Come on,

38:53.180 --> 38:54.060
Okay.

38:55.310 --> 38:56.140
Look.

38:58.270 --> 39:01.120
♫Stepping on the old time♫

38:59.060 --> 39:00.120
Excellent!

39:00.140 --> 39:00.870
Have another bite.

39:00.890 --> 39:01.470
Good,

39:01.540 --> 39:03.200
this crucian carp soup is very nourishing.

39:01.780 --> 39:05.470
♫The wind blows gently♫

39:04.750 --> 39:07.510
Crossing the red line and violating policies,

39:06.250 --> 39:10.090
♫Blowing through the forest and the city♫

39:07.800 --> 39:08.950
I can't do it,

39:08.990 --> 39:10.260
nor can it be done.

39:10.470 --> 39:11.350
How about this?

39:11.360 --> 39:14.260
♫Blowing through your face♫

39:12.280 --> 39:13.310
All of you

39:13.310 --> 39:14.430
write a report together.

39:14.950 --> 39:16.500
Describe Siyi's situation

39:15.260 --> 39:18.700
♫And my heart♫

39:16.520 --> 39:17.850
in detail.

39:17.870 --> 39:19.350
Have the neighborhood submit it up the chain.

39:19.600 --> 39:21.500
Because Granny Ma's family situation

39:19.740 --> 39:23.130
♫The wind is blowing gently♫

39:21.550 --> 39:23.070
is indeed quite special.

39:23.340 --> 39:26.340
♫Blowing through summer♫

39:23.530 --> 39:25.440
We will definitely pay attention to it

39:25.550 --> 39:26.510
and try our best

39:26.630 --> 39:29.720
♫Blowing through the eaves♫

39:26.710 --> 39:28.690
to resolve the actual difficulties.

39:29.190 --> 39:30.620
That's great, Ms. Gu!

39:30.290 --> 39:32.530
♫Blowing across my♫

39:30.660 --> 39:31.710
Let's do it this way.

39:31.730 --> 39:32.610
We'll go to the neighborhood center.

39:32.820 --> 39:36.890
♫Warm love♫

39:32.900 --> 39:33.910
But how should we write it?

39:33.960 --> 39:35.150
I'll write it, I'll write it.

39:35.150 --> 39:35.590
Okay, okay.

39:35.590 --> 39:35.990
Thank you, thank you.

39:35.990 --> 39:37.070
Give it a try.

39:37.070 --> 39:37.480
Thank you so much.

39:37.480 --> 39:38.630
I really can't accept this.

39:38.170 --> 39:39.950
♫After all these years♫

39:38.630 --> 39:39.520
I can't take it

39:39.700 --> 39:43.980
[Breakfast]

39:40.240 --> 39:44.390
♫Have you changed?♫

39:41.590 --> 39:42.760
This is for the tofu pudding.

39:42.870 --> 39:43.660
Thank you.

39:44.960 --> 39:46.650
♫After all these years♫

39:45.260 --> 39:46.250
Well,

39:46.700 --> 39:48.840
ask the doctor later

39:47.440 --> 39:50.670
♫The old times of love♫

39:48.950 --> 39:49.870
how you should take this.

39:49.990 --> 39:51.550
Angong Niuhuang Pill.

39:51.810 --> 39:53.700
♫How far has it gone?♫

39:51.980 --> 39:53.700
It's an old medicine from 1982.

39:53.720 --> 39:55.090
I saved it for my wife.

39:54.560 --> 39:58.140
♫I was lost in a distance♫

39:55.420 --> 39:56.310
She never got to use it.

39:56.310 --> 39:56.710
No, no.

39:56.780 --> 39:57.730
It's yours now.

39:58.190 --> 39:59.460
No, no, this is too expensive.

39:58.780 --> 40:00.860
♫I can't forget♫

39:59.500 --> 40:00.960
Mr. Zhou, I can't accept this.

40:00.990 --> 40:02.590
Please take it back. I can't take it.

40:01.360 --> 40:05.250
♫The first growth♫

40:02.660 --> 40:05.120
Listen, I don't like polite refusals.

40:05.250 --> 40:06.550
Siyi is still young.

40:06.880 --> 40:08.000
♫The world♫

40:07.040 --> 40:08.140
For her,

40:08.650 --> 40:12.440
♫How many emotions are there?♫

40:09.020 --> 40:10.680
you need to take good care of yourself.

40:13.420 --> 40:15.070
♫I love you♫

40:14.570 --> 40:15.480
I know.

40:15.730 --> 40:19.510
♫In dreams or in the south♫

40:20.420 --> 40:23.280
♫Wind blows gently♫

40:24.030 --> 40:27.350
♫On you♫

40:27.990 --> 40:29.710
♫That's me♫

40:30.270 --> 40:34.080
♫Thinking of you deeply♫

41:03.730 --> 41:05.630
♫That's me♫

41:06.250 --> 41:12.030
♫Thinking of you deeply♫

41:07.670 --> 41:08.480
Administrator!

41:08.550 --> 41:09.300
Manager!

41:11.150 --> 41:11.590
Come here.

41:11.590 --> 41:12.720
The server is done.

41:13.430 --> 41:14.130
All right.

41:21.470 --> 41:22.790
Hurry up.

41:23.150 --> 41:24.150
Qiang.

41:24.470 --> 41:25.620
I'm saying, take it easy.

41:25.640 --> 41:26.410
The way you're doing it,

41:26.470 --> 41:27.710
no amount of keyboards will be enough.

41:28.990 --> 41:30.140
Why are you so talkative?

41:30.140 --> 41:30.710
Just change it quickly.

41:30.750 --> 41:31.740
When are you coming back?

41:31.840 --> 41:32.520
Still playing around? Why aren't you looking for a job?

41:32.550 --> 41:33.630
I want to look around a bit more.

41:33.630 --> 41:34.500
What's the rush?

41:34.560 --> 41:36.230
The financing environment is so bad right now.

41:36.250 --> 41:37.340
Take a little more time to regroup.

41:37.390 --> 41:38.060
Qiang,

41:38.060 --> 41:38.710
if you ask me,

41:38.710 --> 41:39.460
you should just give up on starting a business.

41:39.460 --> 41:40.960
You'd better come back soon.

41:41.000 --> 41:42.050
Your parents are going crazy.

41:42.070 --> 41:43.230
Just find a steady job to work.

41:43.230 --> 41:44.390
It's better than now, right?

41:44.590 --> 41:45.790
Xingchi and I, because of you,

41:45.790 --> 41:46.810
both got a beating.

41:46.840 --> 41:48.390
We can still take it,

41:48.390 --> 41:49.550
but our butts can't handle it anymore.

41:49.550 --> 41:50.320
All of them will be from the elite universities.

41:50.340 --> 41:51.150
All of them will be from the elite universities.

41:51.150 --> 41:51.700
Do you believe that?

41:51.700 --> 41:52.770
Okay, okay, Qiang.

41:52.830 --> 41:53.500
I know.

41:53.540 --> 41:54.980
That website you had before,

41:55.000 --> 41:56.160
the idea was really good.

41:56.190 --> 41:57.840
It's a shame it didn't work out, right?

41:58.010 --> 42:00.590
What's the use of creativity in the Internet?

42:00.990 --> 42:01.750
You don't know anything.

42:05.980 --> 42:07.110
Ideas are useless.

42:07.380 --> 42:08.500
Then what's useful?

42:13.550 --> 42:14.070
Sir,

42:14.390 --> 42:15.140
excuse me.

42:15.200 --> 42:17.170
I'm also in the internet business.

42:17.320 --> 42:18.440
You're a senior in the field.

42:19.130 --> 42:21.180
I'd like to ask for your advice.

42:21.550 --> 42:23.650
I've been starting businesses since 1995 until now.

42:24.260 --> 42:25.570
I've failed four times.

42:25.990 --> 42:27.730
Are you sure you want to hear my opinion?

42:28.750 --> 42:30.750
Failure is the mother of success.

42:31.520 --> 42:33.090
Even in the toughest times,

42:33.150 --> 42:34.910
Ma Huateng wanted to sell Tencent.

42:34.970 --> 42:36.560
But it turned out well in the end, didn't it?

42:43.140 --> 42:44.450
You just came to Beijing, right?

42:44.940 --> 42:46.360
How did you know?

42:47.090 --> 42:49.240
I've seen many young people like you.

42:49.430 --> 42:51.540
Carrying passion and dreams,

42:53.160 --> 42:54.290
struggling for a few years,

42:54.450 --> 42:56.360
you'll end up with a broken heart

42:56.510 --> 42:58.770
and an empty wallet, slinking away.

43:02.150 --> 43:03.620
There are those who fail,

43:03.820 --> 43:05.370
but aren't there also those who succeed?

43:05.610 --> 43:07.810
How will I know if I can make it if I don't try?
